{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And she said. Nurse.</b> The masters of the yod: in the hif'il the yod is sometimes interchanged, for from ידע comes תודיע with vav. And sometimes an absent quiescent is placed between the servile letter and the עי״ן in place of the yod, and sometimes it is written, and sometimes not — thus ותניק לך את הילד."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:30:57.893979488Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}